mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{eligible}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 即「法规允许追溯的状态集」，通常排除已 final 清关放行的记录。把这组参数写死在代码里是本节的最后一个反模式——追溯边界随法域和时期变化，它必须和门槛一样是<strong>生效期感知的规则</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落到工程-一个最小可核验的判定接口\">落到工程：一个最小可核验的判定接口</h2><p>把上述建模收拢成一个可测试的契约：<code>resolve_rules(jurisdiction, occurred_at, as_of, product_dims) -&gt; rule_version</code>，以及 <code>evaluate(parcel, rule_version) -&gt; decision</code>。两个函数分离，让「选版本」和「算税费」各自可独立单测；版本选择用固定的历史事件做回归，税费计算用固定版本做回归。<strong>判定结果必须持久化 <code>rule_version_id</code> 与 <code>as_of</code></strong>，否则半年后一次法规变更将无法解释当时的输出为什么是那个数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自检清单：候选规则是否按 jurisdiction 收窄？时间求交是否用事件时间而非处理时间？区间是否经过不重叠校验？重算是否幂等且 append-only？日边界是否按法域时区？追溯边界是否也是规则？这六问对任何低值包裹合规引擎都成立，无论其底层是关系库、规则引擎（Drools/OPA）还是自研 DSL。这也正是本 hub 后续讨论门槛判定与申报流程的公共地基：政策规则的时间语义若建模错了，后面所有环节的准确性都无从谈起。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生效期感知的政策规则引擎：版本化、法域维度与回溯解释","id":"生效期感知的政策规则引擎-版本化-法域维度与回溯解释"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么「一张门槛表」在低值包裹场景里必然失效","id":"核心概念-为什么-一张门槛表-在低值包裹场景里必然失效"},{"level":2,"text":"双时间轴：事件时间与登记时间必须分开存","id":"双时间轴-事件时间与登记时间必须分开存"},{"level":2,"text":"法域维度：门槛不是标量，而是一张受约束的决策矩阵","id":"法域维度-门槛不是标量-而是一张受约束的决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"规则版本化：不可变快照 + 单调递增的版本链","id":"规则版本化-不可变快照-单调递增的版本链"},{"level":2,"text":"回溯解释：重算、差额与幂等记账","id":"回溯解释-重算-差额与幂等记账"},{"level":2,"text":"落到工程：一个最小可核验的判定接口","id":"落到工程-一个最小可核验的判定接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"低值免税门槛的法域分类与构成要素（Section 321 / 欧盟 €150 / IOSS）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demiminimis-lowvalue-parcel-policy/policy-rule-model/de-minimis-threshold-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"包裹级免税资格判定模型：内在价值、合并计额与来源地豁免","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demiminimis-lowvalue-parcel-policy/policy-rule-model/parcel-eligibility-determination"}}